Scope: this license covers the code and documentation written for this
repository (fix/, scripts/, reports/, README files). It does NOT cover the
dataset in data/, which is third-party data redistributed under its own
terms:

- data/input/bibliographic_metadata_cleaned.csv is a byte-identical copy of
  the file of the same name from Project 02,
  https://github.com/shotatsertsvadze/doaj-dublin-core-mapping, which in turn
  copied it unmodified from Project 01,
  https://github.com/shotatsertsvadze/bibliographic-metadata-quality. It
  originates from the Library Carpentry OpenRefine lesson
  (https://github.com/LibraryCarpentry/lc-open-refine), Copyright (c) The
  Carpentries, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- The underlying article metadata originates from the Directory of Open
  Access Journals (DOAJ, https://doaj.org), which releases article-level
  metadata under CC0 1.0 (https://doaj.org/terms/). Individual articles'
  own licences (preserved verbatim in the Licence column and in each
  record's MODS accessCondition) are separate from this metadata licence.
- The MODS 3.8 XML Schema vendored under reports/schema/ is Copyright (c)
  Library of Congress (https://www.loc.gov/standards/mods/), redistributed
  for reproducibility; it is not covered by this license either.

